              <p><li>You may choose to close your PPI Account at any time. To initiate voluntary closure, please contact us at <a href='mailto:contact.us@Pay10.in'>contact.us@Pay10.in</a> or through any other official  communication channels provided by Pay10. Such closure or withdrawal, or transfer of any Available Balance will be processed, subject to completion of applicable due diligence and KYC verification, along with any other terms and conditions set by Pay10.</li></p>
